  "notes": "Loanword from English \"play.\" Refers to action in sports and games; with する it means to play (a sport).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ナイスプレー: nice play (a good move)\n- ファインプレー: a fine play; a brilliant move\n- フェアプレー: fair play; sportsmanship\n- プレーする: to play (a sport or game)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {演技|えんぎ}: performance, acting — used for figure skating and gymnastics routines, and for stage acting\n- {試合|しあい}: match, game — the whole contest, not an individual play within it",
